| ❌ Ignores `costh/sinth` material rotation | ✅ Build 8×8 rotation matrix `T`, apply `T^T * k_local * T` |
| ❌ Uses `d66 = G`, but `B` injects `γ_xy` → mismatch | ✅ Fixed by `0.5` above |

